{"id": "0f692d4f-a777-4802-a6dc-3bc4a8d67b08", "slug": "crystalline-networks-1", "title": "CRYSTALLINE NETWORKS", "description": "Crystalline Networks Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"CRYSTALLINE NETWORKS\"\ndescription: \"Crystalline Networks Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F4F4F5\"\n  secondary: \"#666666\"\n  accent: \"#F4F4F5\"\n  background: \"#020202\"\n  surface: \"#F4F4F5\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#666666\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# CRYSTALLINE NETWORKS\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 10; favorites: 5; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nCrystalline Networks Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nCore Systems Node Access Telemetry Protocol CRYS-NET-v3 0x8F9A2B System State COMPILING 00:00:00 Crystalline Networks Autonomous Neural Lattices Primary Directive Engineering advanced cognitive architectures through pro…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Crystalline; Networks; Deployed Matrices; Prismatic Nexus; Obsidian Thread; Active Schema.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F4F4F5, secondary #666666, accent #F4F4F5, background #020202, surface #F4F4F5, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>CRYSTALLINE NETWORKS</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@100;200;300&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#020202] text-[#F4F4F5] font-extralight antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#F4F4F5] selection:text-[#020202]\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[-1] pointer-events-none w-screen h-screen\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative max-w-[1600px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 min-h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- Architectural Lines & Nodes -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-6 md:left-12 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#1a1a1c] z-[-1]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-6 md:right-12 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#1a1a1c] z-[-1]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-[22px] md:left-[46px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-[#020202] border border-[#333336]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-[22px] md:right-[46px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-[#020202] border border-[#333336]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-[22px] md:left-[46px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-[#020202] border border-[#333336]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-[22px] md:right-[46px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-[#020202] border border-[#333336]\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header Addition -->\n        <header class=\"relative z-20 w-full pt-12 flex justify-between items-center mix-blend-difference\">\n            <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Home\" class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:threejs\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"text-[#F4F4F5]\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex gap-8 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\" aria-label=\"Main Navigation\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#F4F4F5] transition-colors\">Core Systems</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#F4F4F5] transition-colors\">Node Access</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#F4F4F5] transition-colors\">Telemetry</a>\n            </nav>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section id=\"landing\" class=\"relative min-h-[calc(100vh-112px)] flex flex-col justify-between pt-12 pb-24\">\n\n            <!-- Top Data Bar -->\n            <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-start pointer-events-none z-10 mix-blend-difference\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Protocol</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">CRYS-NET-v3</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">0x8F9A2B</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 text-right\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">System State</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">COMPILING</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" id=\"clock\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">00:00:00</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Left Aligned Typographic Layout -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start w-full mt-16 mix-blend-difference reveal-group\">\n                <h1 class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl leading-none tracking-tight uppercase font-thin\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">Crystalline</span></span>\n                </h1>\n                <h1 class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl leading-none tracking-tight uppercase font-thin\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-[#666]\">Networks</span></span>\n                </h1>\n                <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-2xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight font-thin\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">Autonomous</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">Neural</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">Lattices</span></span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Data Module -->\n            <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-12 mt-24 border-b border-[#1a1a1c] pb-8 reveal-group\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-xl\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Primary Directive</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\">\n                        <span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-sm text-[#a3a3a3] leading-relaxed\">\n                            Engineering advanced cognitive architectures through proprietary synthetic node generation. Maximizing data throughput, structural integrity, and computational density across distributed void meshes.\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#666]\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Commence sequence</span></span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Prototypes Section -->\n        <section id=\"drops\" class=\"relative py-24 flex flex-col gap-24\">\n\n            <!-- Section Header -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-6 reveal-group\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden mb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Iteration_01</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\">\n                        <h2 class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight font-thin\">Deployed Matrices</h2>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\">\n                    <span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Cluster: Node-9</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Horizontal Layout -->\n            <div class=\"group relative p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#333336] via-[#1a1a1c] to-transparent w-full reveal-group\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#030303] flex flex-col lg:flex-row relative z-10 w-full overflow-hidden\">\n\n                    <!-- Visual Split -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 h-[400px] lg:h-auto min-h-[400px] relative overflow-hidden border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-[#1a1a1c]\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614850523459-c2f4c699c52e?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=800&fit=max&auto=format&q=80\" alt=\"Aura gradient visual\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-50 mix-blend-luminosity group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:mix-blend-normal group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#F4F4F5] drop-shadow-md\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">ID: NEON-77</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-[#020202] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2 py-1 tracking-widest w-max\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">LOGIC_CORE</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Info Split -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 p-8 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight font-thin\">Prismatic Nexus</h3>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Architecture: (Quantum x Optical) x Void Mesh</span>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-[#a3a3a3] mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-md\">Engineered for absolute processing supremacy. Radiates intense ultraviolet energy during peak calculation cycles. Distinctive resonance of ionized quartz and cold static.</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-4 mt-12\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col border-b border-[#111] pb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666] mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Classification</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Processor Dom.</span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col border-b border-[#111] pb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666] mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Gestation</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">12-14 Cycles</span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col border-b border-[#111] pb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666] mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Morphology</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Fractal Geometry</span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col border-b border-[#111] pb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666] mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Active Index</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">98-99%</span></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <button class=\"mt-12 bg-transparent border border-[#1a1a1c] hover:border-[#F4F4F5] text-[#F4F4F5] py-4 px-6 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors flex justify-between items-center group/btn w-full md:w-auto\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                            Extract Telemetry\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg group-hover/btn:translate-x-2 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Horizontal Layout Reversed -->\n            <div class=\"group relative p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-l from-[#333336] via-[#1a1a1c] to-transparent w-full reveal-group\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#030303] flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse relative z-10 w-full overflow-hidden\">\n\n                    <!-- Visual Split -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 h-[400px] lg:h-auto min-h-[400px] relative overflow-hidden border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-l border-[#1a1a1c]\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1557672172-298e090bd0f1?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=800&fit=max&auto=format&q=80\" alt=\"Aura gradient field\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-50 mix-blend-luminosity group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:mix-blend-normal group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#F4F4F5] drop-shadow-md w-full text-right\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">ID: OBSD-42</span>\n                            <div class=\"w-full flex justify-end\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-[#020202] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2 py-1 tracking-widest w-max\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">DATA_SINK</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Info Split -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 p-8 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight font-thin\">Obsidian Thread</h3>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Architecture: Dark Matter x Null State</span>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-[#a3a3a3] mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-md\">A hyper-dense, light-consuming framework. Designed for deep archive storage and absolute quantum encryption. Emits low-frequency vibrations resembling deep tectonic shifts.</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-4 mt-12\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col border-b border-[#111] pb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666] mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Classification</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Storage Matrix</span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col border-b border-[#111] pb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666] mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Gestation</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">80-90 Cycles</span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col border-b border-[#111] pb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666] mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Morphology</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Singularity</span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col border-b border-[#111] pb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666] mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Active Index</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">44-48%</span></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <button class=\"mt-12 bg-transparent border border-[#1a1a1c] hover:border-[#F4F4F5] text-[#F4F4F5] py-4 px-6 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors flex justify-between items-center group/btn w-full md:w-auto\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                            Extract Telemetry\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg group-hover/btn:translate-x-2 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Animated Schema Section -->\n        <section id=\"schema\" class=\"relative py-24 flex flex-col gap-12 border-t border-[#1a1a1c]\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-6 reveal-group\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden mb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Visualization_02</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\">\n                        <h2 class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight font-thin\">Active Schema</h2>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden\">\n                    <span class=\"word-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#666]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Status: Real-time</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-[500px] border border-[#1a1a1c] bg-[#030303] relative overflow-hidden reveal-group p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#333336] to-transparent\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[1px] bg-[#020202]\" id=\"schema-container\">\n                    <!-- Data overlays -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 z-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">LIVE_TOPOLOGY</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 z-10 pointer-events-none flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#F4F4F5] animate-pulse\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#F4F4F5]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">SYNCING</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Logic & Animations -->\n    <script>\n        // System Clock\n        setInterval(() => {\n            const now = new Date();\n            document.getElementById('clock').innerText = now.toISOString().substr(11, 8);\n        }, 1000);\n\n        // GSAP Masked Reveal Directive\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        const revealGroups = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-group');\n\n        revealGroups.forEach(group => {\n            const words = group.querySelectorAll('.word-reveal');\n            gsap.to(words, {\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: group,\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                },\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: group.closest('#landing') ? 0.2 : 0\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Background WebGL Shader Setup\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        scene.fog = new THREE.Fog('#020202', 3, 10);\n\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n        camera.position.set(0, 0, 5);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        const vertexShader = `\n            varying vec3 vNormal;\n            varying vec3 vPosition;\n            varying vec2 vUv;\n            uniform float time;\n\n            vec3 mod289(vec3 x) { return x - floor(x * (1.0 / 289.0)) * 289.0; }\n            vec4 mod289(vec4 x) { return x - floor(x * (1.0 / 289.0)) * 289.0; }\n            vec4 permute(vec4 x) { return mod289(((x*34.0)+1.0)*x); }\n            vec4 taylorInvSqrt(vec4 r) { return 1.79284291400159 - 0.85373472095314 * r; }\n            float snoise(vec3 v) {\n                const vec2  C = vec2(1.0/6.0, 1.0/3.0) ;\n                const vec4  D = vec4(0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0);\n                vec3 i  = floor(v + dot(v, C.yyy) );\n                vec3 x0 = v - i + dot(i, C.xxx) ;\n                vec3 g = step(x0.yzx, x0.xyz);\n                vec3 l = 1.0 - g;\n                vec3 i1 = min( g.xyz, l.zxy );\n                vec3 i2 = max( g.xyz, l.zxy );\n                vec3 x1 = x0 - i1 + C.xxx;\n                vec3 x2 = x0 - i2 + C.yyy;\n                vec3 x3 = x0 - D.yyy;\n                i = mod289(i);\n                vec4 p = permute( permute( permute( i.z + vec4(0.0, i1.z, i2.z, 1.0 )) + i.y + vec4(0.0, i1.y, i2.y, 1.0 )) + i.x + vec4(0.0, i1.x, i2.x, 1.0 ));\n                float n_ = 0.142857142857;\n                vec3  ns = n_ * D.wyz - D.xzx;\n                vec4 j = p - 49.0 * floor(p * ns.z * ns.z);\n                vec4 x_ = floor(j * ns.z);\n                vec4 y_ = floor(j - 7.0 * x_ );\n                vec4 x = x_ *ns.x + ns.yyyy;\n                vec4 y = y_ *ns.x + ns.yyyy;\n                vec4 h = 1.0 - abs(x) - abs(y);\n                vec4 b0 = vec4( x.xy, y.xy );\n                vec4 b1 = vec4( x.zw, y.zw );\n                vec4 s0 = floor(b0)*2.0 + 1.0;\n                vec4 s1 = floor(b1)*2.0 + 1.0;\n                vec4 sh = -step(h, vec4(0.0));\n                vec4 a0 = b0.xzyw + s0.xzyw*sh.xxyy ;\n                vec4 a1 = b1.xzyw + s1.xzyw*sh.zzww ;\n                vec3 p0 = vec3(a0.xy,h.x);\n                vec3 p1 = vec3(a0.zw,h.y);\n                vec3 p2 = vec3(a1.xy,h.z);\n                vec3 p3 = vec3(a1.zw,h.w);\n                vec4 norm = taylorInvSqrt(vec4(dot(p0,p0), dot(p1,p1), dot(p2, p2), dot(p3,p3)));\n                p0 *= norm.x; p1 *= norm.y; p2 *= norm.z; p3 *= norm.w;\n                vec4 m = max(0.6 - vec4(dot(x0,x0), dot(x1,x1), dot(x2,x2), dot(x3,x3)), 0.0);\n                m = m * m;\n                return 42.0 * dot( m*m, vec4( dot(p0,x0), dot(p1,x1), dot(p2,x2), dot(p3,x3) ) );\n            }\n\n            void main() {\n                vUv = uv;\n                vNormal = normalize(normalMatrix * normal);\n\n                float noise = snoise(vec3(position.x * 1.5 + time * 0.1, position.y * 1.5, position.z * 1.5));\n                vec3 newPosition = position + normal * (noise * 0.25);\n\n                vPosition = (modelViewMatrix * vec4(newPosition, 1.0)).xyz;\n                gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(newPosition, 1.0);\n            }\n        `;\n\n        const fragmentShader = `\n            varying vec3 vNormal;\n            varying vec3 vPosition;\n\n            vec3 palette( in float t, in vec3 a, in vec3 b, in vec3 c, in vec3 d ) {\n                return a + b*cos( 6.28318*(c*t+d) );\n            }\n\n            void main() {\n                vec3 viewDirection = normalize(-vPosition);\n\n                float fresnel = dot(viewDirection, vNormal);\n                fresnel = clamp(1.0 - fresnel, 0.0, 1.0);\n                fresnel = pow(fresnel, 2.5);\n\n                float colorFactor = vNormal.x * 0.5 + vNormal.y * 0.5 + 0.5;\n\n                vec3 a = vec3(0.5, 0.1, 0.5);\n                vec3 b = vec3(0.5, 0.2, 0.6);\n                vec3 c = vec3(1.0, 1.0, 1.0);\n                vec3 d = vec3(0.4, 0.1, 0.8);\n\n                vec3 baseColor = palette(colorFactor + fresnel, a, b, c, d);\n\n                vec3 finalColor = mix(vec3(0.02, 0.01, 0.02), baseColor, fresnel * 1.2);\n                finalColor += vec3(0.9, 0.2, 0.7) * pow(fresnel, 4.0);\n\n                gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 0.7);\n            }\n        `;\n\n        const geometry = new THREE.TorusGeometry(1.0, 0.35, 128, 128);\n\n        const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n            vertexShader: vertexShader,\n            fragmentShader: fragmentShader,\n            uniforms: {\n                time: { value: 0.0 }\n            },\n            transparent: true,\n            wireframe: false\n        });\n\n        const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n        mesh.position.y = 0;\n        if(window.innerWidth > 768) {\n            mesh.position.x = 2;\n        }\n        scene.add(mesh);\n\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let targetX = 0;\n        let targetY = 0;\n        const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n        const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n            mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX) * 0.0005;\n            mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY) * 0.0005;\n        });\n\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        // Animated Schema WebGL Setup\n        const schemaContainer = document.getElementById('schema-container');\n        const schemaScene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const schemaCamera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, schemaContainer.clientWidth / schemaContainer.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n        schemaCamera.position.z = 40;\n\n        const schemaRenderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n        schemaRenderer.setSize(schemaContainer.clientWidth, schemaContainer.clientHeight);\n        schemaRenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        schemaContainer.appendChild(schemaRenderer.domElement);\n\n        const particleCount = 120;\n        const schemaGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const schemaPositions = new Float32Array(particleCount * 3);\n        const schemaVelocities = [];\n\n        for(let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n            schemaPositions[i*3] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 80;\n            schemaPositions[i*3+1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 80;\n            schemaPositions[i*3+2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 80;\n            schemaVelocities.push({\n                x: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.15,\n                y: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.15,\n                z: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.15\n            });\n        }\n\n        schemaGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(schemaPositions, 3));\n        const schemaMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({ color: 0xF4F4F5, size: 0.6 });\n        const schemaParticles = new THREE.Points(schemaGeometry, schemaMaterial);\n        schemaScene.add(schemaParticles);\n\n        const lineMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x333336, transparent: true, opacity: 0.4 });\n        const lineGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const linesMesh = new THREE.LineSegments(lineGeometry, lineMaterial);\n        schemaScene.add(linesMesh);\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n            // Background Animation\n            material.uniforms.time.value = elapsedTime;\n            targetX = mouseX * 0.5;\n            targetY = mouseY * 0.5;\n            mesh.rotation.y += 0.002 + (targetX - mesh.rotation.y) * 0.05;\n            mesh.rotation.x += 0.001 + (targetY - mesh.rotation.x) * 0.05;\n            mesh.position.y = Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.3) * 0.1;\n            const scrollY = window.scrollY;\n            mesh.position.z = -scrollY * 0.002;\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n\n            // Schema Animation\n            const positions = schemaParticles.geometry.attributes.position.array;\n            for(let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n                positions[i*3] += schemaVelocities[i].x;\n                positions[i*3+1] += schemaVelocities[i].y;\n                positions[i*3+2] += schemaVelocities[i].z;\n\n                if(Math.abs(positions[i*3]) > 40) schemaVelocities[i].x *= -1;\n                if(Math.abs(positions[i*3+1]) > 40) schemaVelocities[i].y *= -1;\n                if(Math.abs(positions[i*3+2]) > 40) schemaVelocities[i].z *= -1;\n            }\n            schemaParticles.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n            const linePositions = [];\n            for(let i=0; i<particleCount; i++) {\n                for(let j=i+1; j<particleCount; j++) {\n                    const dx = positions[i*3] - positions[j*3];\n                    const dy = positions[i*3+1] - positions[j*3+1];\n                    const dz = positions[i*3+2] - positions[j*3+2];\n                    const dist = Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy + dz*dz);\n\n                    if(dist < 12) {\n                        linePositions.push(\n                            positions[i*3], positions[i*3+1], positions[i*3+2],\n                            positions[j*3], positions[j*3+1], positions[j*3+2]\n                        );\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            linesMesh.geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(linePositions, 3));\n            schemaParticles.rotation.y += 0.0005;\n            linesMesh.rotation.y += 0.0005;\n            schemaRenderer.render(schemaScene, schemaCamera);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            // Background resize\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            if(window.innerWidth > 768) {\n                mesh.position.x = 2;\n            } else {\n                mesh.position.x = 0;\n            }\n\n            // Schema resize\n            if(schemaContainer) {\n                schemaCamera.aspect = schemaContainer.clientWidth / schemaContainer.clientHeight;\n                schemaCamera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                schemaRenderer.setSize(schemaContainer.clientWidth, schemaContainer.clientHeight);\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "crystalline-networks-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s-v3/crystalline-networks-1.jpg", "source_name": "crystalline-networks-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 137, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T15:05:03.065727+00:00"}